source_changes:
- StorySparkRemix/SparkStore.swift: DraftDeleteConfirmation tracks shelf delete candidate and confirms deletion.
- StorySparkRemix/Views.swift: SparkShelfView routes Delete through DraftDeleteConfirmation alert; DraftPulseCard buttons use borderless style so Edit and Delete do not both fire inside the List row; controls have stable accessibility identifiers for runtime evidence.
- StorySparkRemix/StorySparkRemixApp.swift: -ui-testing launch resets defaults before creating stores, keeping UI runtime evidence deterministic.
- StorySparkRemixTests/SparkRemixerTests.swift: focused unit test now covers request confirmation candidate -> confirm delete -> persisted empty store.
- StorySparkRemixUITests/StorySparkRemixUITests.swift: XCUITest creates a microdraft, edits/saves it, opens delete confirmation, confirms Delete, and verifies the delete button is gone.

